  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> </p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>·</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>·</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Which is a linear differential equation, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Solution of the differential equation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now, taking case I: when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></math> (rejected)</p><p>Case-II: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mtext>so </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and also  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is constant function, so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
